  "body_text": "You don't often get email from beagle@chats.beaglesecurity.com. Learn why this is important\n\nHi Giles,\n\nThank you for reaching out and for sharing the details about your environment and requirements.\n\nI have forwarded your concerns to the appropriate team for review. I’ll get back to you with a detailed explanation of how our platform can help with your specific environment and security requirements.\n\nThank you for your patience.\n\n--\n\nBeagle from Beagle Security.\n\nReply directly to this email, or go to chat.\n\nOn Fri, 18 Sep 2026 11:55:20 GMT Purchasing wrote:\n\nHi,\nI received an email about your application security audits and wanted to understand a bit more about what the service offers.\nWhen I looked into it, it appeared to be focused primarily on monitoring and testing website applications, and I wasn't sure how this would apply to our setup.\nOur main systems are Microsoft 365, Dropbox, and Asana, along with a single DNS entry that points to an AI application hosted on a VPS. Other than that, I'm not aware of any additional applications that would fall into the category of web applications.\nWe are interested in improving our security posture and would likely benefit from a penetration test, but when I previously reviewed the audit process, I remember being asked a number of highly technical questions that I wasn't able to answer. I also got the impression that the service was limited to website or web application security and didn't extend to the wider systems we use.\nCould you help me understand what value we could gain from the platform given our environment, and whether it can assess or provide recommendations beyond public-facing websites and web applications? If so, I'd be happy to revisit it.\nMany Thanks,\n\nGiles\n\nPurchasing Manager\n\nSesame Access Systems Ltd\n\nUnit 1, Cumberland Works\n\nWintersells Business Park\n\nWest Byfleet\n\nSurrey\n\nUnited Kingdom\n\nKT14 7LF\n\nOffice: 01784 440088\n\nDIRECT LINE : 01784 904484\n\nEmail: purchasing@sesameaccess.commailto:purchasing@sesameaccess.com\n\nWeb: www.sesameaccess.comhttp://www.sesameaccess.com/\n\nYouTube: www.youtube.com/sesameaccesshttp://www.youtube.com/sesameaccess\n\nOn Fri, 31 Oct 2025 14:45:02 GMT visitor584305 wrote:\n\nhi i spoke with Abey Koshy Itty and he said can i request that you aurhorise through the backend as we have a challeng in our verifcation process",
